{"page":1,"results":[{"adult":false,"gender":2,"id":119294,"known_for_department":"Directing","name":"Abbas Kiarostami","original_name":"عباس کیارستمی","popularity":1.9926,"profile_path":"/rTlz5ciu41FxyVuXA82a3tSYVZ8.jpg","known_for":[{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/44SNTCSZTdbF5bzgUy4IfPV3DUq.jpg","id":30020,"title":"Taste of Cherry","original_title":"طعم گيلاس","overview":"A middle-aged Tehranian man, Mr. Badii is intent on killing himself and seeks someone to bury him after his demise. Driving around the city, the seemingly well-to-do Badii meets with numerous people, including a Muslim student, asking them to take on the job, but initially he has little luck. Eventually, Badii finds a man who is up for the task because he needs the money, but his new associate soon tries to talk him out of committing suicide.","poster_path":"/vgPwjgbSdbYWrS1ty8TIZtmi6Tn.jpg","media_type":"movie","original_language":"fa","genre_ids":[18],"popularity":4.3425,"release_date":"1997-09-28","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":7.691,"vote_count":714},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/3t1qZqP1e17wQshpPKSqII1OogM.jpg","id":30017,"title":"Close-Up","original_title":"کلوزآپ ، نمای نزدیک","overview":"This fiction-documentary hybrid uses a sensational real-life event—the arrest of a young man on charges that he fraudulently impersonated the well-known filmmaker Mohsen Makhmalbaf—as the basis for a stunning, multilayered investigation into movies, identity, artistic creation, and existence, in which the real people from the case play themselves.","poster_path":"/m9HG2N9ZKCmNN9qOHJTNyy18wn3.jpg","media_type":"movie","original_language":"fa","genre_ids":[80,18],"popularity":3.5001,"release_date":"1990-05-09","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":7.954,"vote_count":454},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/slNzn4E0XA1WE0yh9I53oIzXQ4e.jpg","id":48303,"title":"Certified Copy","original_title":"Copie conforme","overview":"In Tuscany to promote his latest book, a middle-aged English wri